          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "title": "Introduction to Version Control",
              "order": 1,
              "data": {
                "text": "Version control is a system that records changes to files over time so that you can recall specific versions later. It's essential for:\n\n• Tracking code changes\n• Collaborating with team members\n• Reverting to previous versions\n• Understanding project history\n• Managing multiple versions simultaneously"
              }
            }
          ]
