            {
              "type": "block",
              "title": "Branch Management",
              "order": 1,
              "data": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "order": 1,
                    "data": {
                      "text": "## Branch Commands\n\n**Create a new branch:**\n```bash\ngit branch feature-name\n```\n\n**Switch to a branch:**\n```bash\ngit checkout feature-name\n# or\ngit switch feature-name\n```\n\n**Create and switch:**\n```bash\ngit checkout -b feature-name\n```"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "video",
                    "order": 2,
                    "data": {
                      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/JTE2Fn_sCZs",
                      "title": "Branch Demo",
                      "duration": 420
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "order": 3,
                    "data": {
                      "text": "**List branches:**\n```bash\ngit branch        # Local branches\ngit branch -a     # All branches\n```\n\n**Delete a branch:**\n```bash\ngit branch -d feature-name\n```"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
